# Used by `vite build` (mode=production) — this is what `npm run build:mobile` runs
# before `npx cap sync`, so it's what gets baked into the iOS/Android app bundles.
# Not a secret: this same URL is already public in capacitor.config.ts and vercel.json.
# Vercel's own web build injects VITE_API_URL via its dashboard env vars, which take
# precedence over this file, so this only affects the native (Capacitor) builds.
VITE_API_URL=https://medico1deploymio-production.up.railway.app
